  "description": "<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Brand introduction</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>On the Way Up Apparel is a brand that was founded in 2023 after many years of contemplation. It was created with the aim of providing high-quality clothing that reflects the spirit of progress and growth. The brand believes in empowering individuals to reach their full potential and express themselves through fashion.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Product description</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>At On the Way Up Apparel, quality and sustainability are of utmost importance. The brand is committed to using ethically sourced materials and environmentally friendly production processes. By choosing On the Way Up Apparel, customers can feel good about their fashion choices and contribute to a more sustainable future.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>On the Way Up Apparel stands out from other clothing brands due to its unique approach. The brand focuses on creating clothing that not only looks good but also serves as a reminder of the wearer's potential for growth and success. Each piece is designed with care and attention to detail, ensuring both style and comfort. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Payment terms</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Initially payments will be made 1 month after delivery to the customer to ensure payments are not returned. We will review this with all affiliates as our relationship grows.<br><br></p>",
